# Working files that must never reach a PUBLIC repo.
#
# Added 27 Aug 2026 after finding these already published at
# github.com/nizar7777/ember-website (a public repo). Untracking them here
# stops future commits carrying them; it does NOT remove them from history
# already on GitHub — see the notes handed to the operator.

# Ad account IDs, campaign plans, budget notes
.claude-ads/

# Agent/editor config
.claude/
.vscode/

# Operational notes: EmailJS service + template IDs, contact routing
SETUP-NEEDED.txt

# Internal order-logging tool. Deliberately excluded from the deploy build;
# the Jekyll Pages workflow serves the repo root, so tracking it here would
# put it on a live URL anyway.
order-entry.html

# Local-only tooling
serve.ps1
tools/

# Mockup PNG masters. The site only ever loads mockup/*.webp (~1.5 MB for
# the set); the PNGs are the ~23 MB originals those are generated from.
# Keep them on disk, out of the repo.
mockup/*.png
mockup/*.jpg
